    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## TODO before enabling\n1. Add credential to **Gmail Send** (`gmail_marc_oauth`)\n2. Update reply template tone + signature in `Build Reply`\n3. Confirm sender mailbox (`marc@riera.co.uk`) is connected\n4. Add credential to **Telegram Internal Ping** if you want alerts\n5. Activate after sending one test lead",
        "height": 350,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "ad7b6f34-8cf4-49ec-ad9b-f035d9a964d1",
      "name": "TODO",
